sequenceDiagram
    participant IDE as IDE Extension
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Comp as Completion Service
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant Rank as Context Ranker
    participant Model as Fast Model (Codestral)
    participant Safety as Safety Scanner

    IDE->>IDE: User types character
    IDE->>IDE: Debounce timer (300ms)
    IDE->>IDE: Timer expires → collect context

    IDE->>GW: POST /completions (timeout: 300ms)
    GW->>GW: Auth + rate limit (5ms)
    GW->>Comp: Route to fast path

    Comp->>Cache: Check cache (prefix hash)
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>Comp: Cached completion
        Comp-->>IDE: Return (< 50ms total)
    else Cache miss
        Comp->>Rank: Rank context within budget
        Rank-->>Comp: FIM prompt (prefix + suffix + related)

        Comp->>Model: Generate completion
        Model-->>Comp: Tokens (< 150ms)

        Comp->>Safety: Security + license check
        Safety-->>Comp: Pass

        Comp->>Cache: Store in cache
        Comp-->>IDE: Return completion
    end

    IDE->>IDE: Render ghost text
    Note over IDE: User presses Tab (accept) or types (reject)
    IDE->>GW: POST /feedback {accepted/rejected}
